  "trol; EMCON silent means no active emissions) where possible to avoid giving away their presence, identity and location.": "管控；EMCON 靜默意味着不進行任何主動輻射)儘可能避免暴露自身的存在、身份與位置。",
  "ESM detections can be made well beyond the maximum range of an emitting radar. Radar sends out radio energy and detects contacts based on their reflection of that energy, but an ESM set only needs to detect the radiated energy--the detected energy doesn't have to be powerful enough to send a reflection for the ESM set to know that there is a contact out there. This is a very important fundamental principle of modern naval and air warfare, and is the main reason why most aircraft and ships prefer to remain EMCON silent (EMCON stands for": "電子支援措施（ESM）的探測距離可以遠遠超出輻射源雷達的最大作用距離。雷達向外發射射頻能量，並依據目標對該能量的反射回波來發現目標；而 ESM 設備只需探測到輻射出來的能量即可——並不要求該能量強到足以產生反射回波，ESM 設備就能判斷該海域存在目標接觸。這是現代海空作戰中極爲重要的一條基本原則，也是大多數飛機與艦艇寧願保持 EMCON 靜默的主要原因(EMCON 意爲",
  "Press \"CTRL + SHIFT + F9\" to bring up the Side Doctrine, EMCON and WRA window, or you can select your aircraft and press \"CTRL + F9\" to bring up the Unit Doctrine, EMCON and WRA). The difference being changing side settings will affect all units on the side, whereas changing just the individual unit settings will affect only that unit.": "按「CTRL + SHIFT + F9」打開【陣營條令、輻射管制與武器投射權限】視窗；或先選中你的戰機，再按「CTRL + F9」打開【單位條令、輻射管制與武器投射權限】視窗)。兩者的區別在於：修改陣營設定會影響該陣營的全部單位，而只修改單個單位的設定僅影響該單位。",
  "Manually: Launch the Fencer, plot a course directly over or very close to the target base. Make sure there is a Waypoint in your course before and after the base with a straight run over the target. When you launch keep your Altitude around 12,000 ft to conserve fuel (not a requirement here but good practice). At the waypoint before the base set your speed to afterburner and your Altitude to about 500ft. At the waypoint after the base slow her down and bring your altitude back up.": "手動方式：起飛「擊劍手」，規劃一條正對或非常貼近目標基地的航線。務必在基地前後各設一個航路點，使航路以直線穿過目標。起飛後保持約 12,000 英尺高度以節省燃油（本課不作硬性要求，但屬良好習慣）。在基地之前的航路點將速度設爲後燃器、高度降至約 500 英尺。在基地之後的航路點減速並把高度拉回。",
  "Message Log and select 'Raise Pop-Up' for any event that you wish. Useful pop-ups for Surface operations include 'Contact Change', 'New Contact', 'Special Messages' (this should always be on), 'Unit Damage', 'Unit Lost' and 'New Weapon Contact'.": "訊息日誌，並對你關心的任何事件勾選「彈出提示」。水面作戰中實用的彈出提示包括「接觸變更」「新接觸」「專用戰情訊息」（建議始終開啓）、「單位受損」「單位損失」與「新武器接觸」。",
  "Message Log settings and view the message log entries--note that since we are not defending against live missiles in this training exercise, decoys will not be deployed.": "訊息日誌設定，並檢視訊息日誌條目——請注意，本次訓練演習中我們並非抵禦實彈飛彈攻擊，因此不會投放誘餌。",
  "Not an issue. Measure the distance between the base and the SA-5 (\"CTRL + D\" & click or select the base and watch the cursor data to see the range as you move the mouse (XXXnm from Sel). I read the SA-5 as 340nm, and the outer limit of the mission 2 box is about 320nm so put in a maximum strike radius of 320 halfway down the center column.": "這不是問題。測量基地與 SA-5 之間的距離（按「CTRL + D」並點擊，或選中基地後移動滑鼠，觀察光標數據中的距離讀數(距所選目標 XXX 海浬）。我實測 SA-5 爲 340 海浬，而任務 2 方框的外緣約爲 320 海浬，因此在中間列的中部填入最大打擊半徑 320。",
  "Special Actions and then select the special action named 'Ready ASW Helicopter' and click 'execute'. The helicopter will then be immediately ready to take off and make another attack.": "特別行動，然後選擇名爲「準備反潛直升機」的特別行動並點擊「執行」。該直升機隨後將立即做好起飛準備，並可再次發起攻擊。",
  "When you detect a suitable contact, launch a RHIB to identify it by opening the Docking Ops window (F7), selecting a RHIB and clicking 'Launch Individually'. Keep an eye on fuel consumption and range for your deployed RHIBs and helicopter. You can recall embarked units be selecting them and pressing 'B' (Return To": "當你發現合適的接觸目標時，按 F7 打開【小艇作業】視窗，選擇一艘硬殼充氣艇（RHIB）並點擊「單艇釋放」以派其前往識別目標。請留意已派出的小艇與直升機的燃油消耗與航程。要召回搭載單位，可選中它們並按「B」(返回",
  "Select HMAS Stuart and order it to replenish from HMAS Sirius by using the right-click unit context menu and selecting 'UNREP if possible' > 'Select Provider Manually' and then clicking on HMAS Sirius": "選中「斯圖爾特」號（HMAS Stuart），使用右鍵單位上下文選單並選擇「如有可能則進行海上補給 (UNREP) > 手動選擇補給艦」，然後點擊「天狼星」號（HMAS Sirius），命令其前往實施補給。",
